#. Description of the plugin
msgid ""
"Scan and remove unused media files from your WordPress site to free "
"up disk space. Deep scans post content, ACF fields, WooCommerce, "
"Elementor, theme files, widgets, and more."
msgstr ""
"Skenirajte in odstranite neuporabljene predstavnostne datoteke s "
"spletnega mesta WordPress, da sprostite prostor na disku. Globoko "
"pregleda vsebino, polja ACF, WooCommerce, Elementor, datoteke teme, "
"gradnike in več."

